{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141420/extras/AboutHeader.png?t=1745044462\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mirrormind is a 3D Puzzle Platformer in a unique lo-fi dithered style where you can shift perspective into any person you can see. Journey through a series of worlds where each world explores a shift in perspective. These shifts include an exploration of gravity, the 2nd person perspective, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141420/extras/MirrormindGameplay.gif?t=1745044462\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141420/extras/KeyFeaturesImage.png?t=1745044462\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore 4 visually striking worlds about switching perspectives: using different directions of gravity, controlling yourself in the 2nd person perspective and switching between past and present.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over 30 different puzzles, each focused on showing some unique and interesting consequence of its mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique undo system where you can reverse time to quickly explore other solutions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A parallel and optional narrative exploring themes of perspective, senses, sights and experience.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mirrormind treats your time as precious; there is no filler in this game and the levels have been crafted to minimize tedium and frustration. There are no puzzles that require a high degree of dexterity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141420/extras/Eye.png?t=1745044462\" /></p>","background":"https://store.