h\">Over 30 different puzzles, each focused on showing some unique and interesting consequence of its mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique undo system where you can reverse time to quickly explore other solutions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A parallel and optional narrative exploring themes of perspective, senses, sights and experience.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mirrormind treats your time as precious; there is no filler in this game and the levels have been crafted to minimize tedium and frustration. There are no puzzles that require a high degree of dexterity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141420/extras/Eye.png?t=1745044462\" /></p>","developers":["Blackwind Software"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141420/header.jpg?t=1745044462","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> A Linux System<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1000 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1000 MB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"name":"Mirrormind","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-7700HQ 2.8GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphi